---
// Frontier Mode — local WebGPU "Mira" that generates NEW discoveries in-browser.
// Standalone: the base game at / works without this. This page proves the AI layer.
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <title>Frontier Mode — Waking Local Mira</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Local WebGPU Mira dreams up new Mars discoveries on your own device." />
    <style is:global>
      :root{color-scheme:dark;--rust:#b85f35;--night:#09070d;--blue:#73d9ff;--gold:#f4bd6f;--cream:#ffe1a0;--green:#9cf0b4}
      *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
      html,body{margin:0;min-height:100svh;font-family:ui-rounded,"Avenir Next",system-ui,sans-serif;color:#ffe9c7}
      body{background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 12%,rgba(115,217,255,.16),transparent 34%),radial-gradient(circle at 74% 22%,rgba(244,189,111,.16),transparent 30%),linear-gradient(180deg,#08060c,#1b0f12 56%,#2b130e);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:1.2rem}
      .card{width:min(680px,100%);border:1px solid rgba(244,189,111,.22);border-radius:1.6rem;padding:clamp(1.2rem,4vw,2.4rem);background:linear-gradient(150deg,rgba(22,14,22,.9),rgba(10,7,13,.92));box-shadow:0 2rem 5rem rgba(0,0,0,.5),inset 0 0 4rem rgba(115,217,255,.06)}
      .kick{letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--gold);font-weight:800}
      h1{margin:.4rem 0 .2rem;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,6vw,3rem);letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:.95}
      p{color:rgba(255,236,204,.8);line-height:1.5}
      .orb{width:120px;height:120px;margin:1rem auto;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(244,189,111,.95) 30%,rgba(115,217,255,.5) 60%,rgba(13,8,15,.9) 82%);box-shadow:0 0 70px rgba(244,189,111,.5),0 0 150px rgba(115,217,255,.25);animation:pulse 2.6s ease-in-out infinite}
      @keyframes pulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 100px rgba(244,189,111,.8),0 0 200px rgba(115,217,255,.45)}}
      .bar{height:10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden;margin:1rem 0}
      .bar > i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--blue));transition:width .3s ease}
      .status{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--blue);min-height:1.3em}
      .btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;padding:.85rem 1.3rem;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),var(--rust));color:#170b07;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}
      .btn.ghost{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:var(--cream);border:1px solid rgba(244,189,111,.3);margin-left:.6rem}
      .row{display:flex;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-top:.4rem}
      .demo{margin-top:1.2rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(244,189,111,.16);display:none}
      .demo.on{display:block}
      .demo .line{background:rgba(9,7,13,.7);border:1px solid rgba(115,217,255,.3);border-radius:14px;padding:.7rem .9rem;margin-top:.6rem;color:var(--green)}
      select{background:rgba(0,0,0,.3);color:var(--cream);border:1px solid rgba(244,189,111,.3);border-radius:10px;padding:.5rem}
      .warn{color:#ff9b8f}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="card">
      <div class="kick">Frontier Mode · runs on your device</div>
      <h1>Wake Local Mira</h1>
      <div class="orb" id="orb"></div>
      <p id="intro">The base mystery plays without any download. Here, a small language model runs
        <strong>entirely in your browser via WebGPU</strong> — no server, no data leaves your machine —
        so Mira can dream up Mars discoveries that were never authored. Every new combo she generates is
        cached, so you and anyone else who tries the same pair get the same result. That is the
        Infinite&nbsp;Craft promise, made local.</p>
      <div class="row">
        <label for="model" class="kick">Model</label>
        <select id="model">
          <option value="onnx-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-mobile-ONNX">Gemma 4 E2B Mobile (default)</option>
          <option value="onnx-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-ONNX">Gemma 4 E2B</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="bar"><i id="fill"></i></div>
      <div class="status" id="status">WebGPU not checked yet.</div>
      <div class="row">
        <button class="btn" id="wake">Wake Mira</button>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/">Back to the mystery</a>
      </div>
      <div class="demo" id="demo">
        <div class="kick">Test a generated discovery</div>
        <div class="row">
          <select id="a"></select><span>+</span><select id="b"></select>
          <button class="btn" id="gen">Generate</button>
        </div>
        <div class="line" id="out">Mira waits.</div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <script type="module" src="/webgpu-mira.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
